            "author": {
              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "Myrtle Bloxham"
            },
            "reviewBody": "I used to make this for the assisted living center residents where I worked. It was a very colorful, yummy autumn dinner. Granted depending on the size of the pumpkin the timing to get it done can be tricky. I love this simpler version. (it does say 'cooked' white) rice. I prefer brown for the higher nutrition and more flavor. Thanks for posting the recipe. I had lost mine.",
            "datePublished": "2010-12-30T19:56:45.923Z"
          },
          {
